Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rust LLM inference engine, server, and desktop GUI
 Llama-rs is a native Rust port of llama.cpp providing LLM inference with:
 .
  * llama-cli — Interactive command-line text generation
  * llama-server — HTTP REST API server with SSE streaming
  * llama-ui — Native desktop GUI built with iced
 .
 Supports GGUF model loading, CUDA GPU acceleration, and multiple
 quantization formats.
